#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:6
msgid "Streaming a camera view in a visualizer"
msgstr "在可视化器中显示相机流视图"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:10
msgid ""
"This guide shows how to show ground-truth camera frames from many "
"environments in one live panel of a visualizer. For how the view works and "
"which visualizers support it, see :ref:`visualization-streaming-camera-"
"view`."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍如何在可视化器的一个实时面板中显示多个环境的相机真值图像。该视图的工作方式和支持的可视化器见 :ref:`visualization-"
"streaming-camera-view` 。"

#: source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view.rst:15
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

