msgid ""
"Run the ``run_tiled_camera_visualizer.py`` script in "
"``IsaacLab/scripts/tutorials/07_visualizers``:"
msgstr ""
"运行 ``IsaacLab/scripts/tutorials/07_visualizers`` 中的 "
"``run_tiled_camera_visualizer.py`` 脚本："

